# --- eGov SuperAgent ---
# Canonical public URL. Used for metadataBase, canonical links, OG images,
# robots.txt and sitemap.xml. Leave unset in production (it defaults to the
# live domain); Vercel preview deployments should set it to the preview URL.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://egovsuperagent.online"

# Optional. Only needed to complete the Facebook Messenger webhook handshake at
# /api/webhook/messenger — the GET verification echoes hub.challenge when the
# token matches. Message handling itself is not wired up in this MVP.
# MESSENGER_VERIFY_TOKEN="a-long-random-string"

# Owner console password (/admin). Required in production — without it the
# console falls back to a development default that is public in this repository.
# ADMIN_PASSWORD="a-long-random-passphrase"

# --- Supabase ---
# Two things depend on this project.
#
# Accounts: with the URL and anon key set, /app/signup and /app/login send and
# verify a real one-time code. Without them the app uses a local mock code
# (123456) and says so on screen.
#
# The eTravel filing queue: with all three set, a declaration filed in /app is a
# row in Postgres that the owner console sees in realtime, and /verify reads
# that row. Without them the app falls back to a device-local store and says so
# on every surface. Apply supabase/migrations first.
#
# URL and anon key are public by design (the anon key only reaches the change
# feed — see supabase/migrations). The service role key is server-only: it
# bypasses row level security and must never be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://xxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="eyJ..."
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="eyJ..."
